  ($t$0813$t$, $t$Newfield Borough$t$, $t$GLOUCESTER$t$, $t$smoke_fire_cert$t$, $t$explicit_required$t$, $t$Smoke / CO alarm certificate$t$, $j$["Issued by: Gloucester County Fire Marshal's Office (county local enforcing agency for the Uniform Fire Code)","Contact: 856-307-7912 · gcfmo@co.gloucester.nj.us","How to apply: No County smoke/CO/extinguisher certificate form or fee for home sales was found on the County website. Call or email the County Fire Marshal's Office (212 County House Road, Clarksboro) and ask how to request the resale inspection for this town, and whether the town collects the application and fee.","Fire official in the NJ state directory (county fire marshal), updated 6/16/2026: Shawn K Layton · (856) 307-7912 · slayton@co.gloucester.nj.us","State rule: a 2025 law (P.L.2025, c.19) dropped the fire extinguisher from the state requirement. Follow the town's current form, which may still list one."]$j$::jsonb, $j$[]$j$::jsonb, null, $t$https://www.gloucestercountynj.gov/359/Office-of-the-Fire-Marshal$t$, $j$[{"url":"https://www.gloucestercountynj.gov/359/Office-of-the-Fire-Marshal","label":"Official source (gloucestercountynj.gov)"},{"url":"https://nj.gov/dca/dfs/pdf/ANNUAL%20REGISTRY/THIRD%20QUARTER%20LEA%20REGISTRY%202026.pdf","label":"Official source (nj.gov)"}]$j$::jsonb, $t$The County Fire Marshal's Office currently is the Local Enforcement Agency (LEA) for the following municipalities: Clayton East Greenwich Elk National Park Newfield Paulsboro South Harrison Wenonah West Deptford Woodbury Woodbury Heights$t$, $t$bcc0524386a71e8dd5c02be0e70d682012ac46994b023184969b22e8b71f0e09$t$, $t$2026-09-30T12:00:00Z$t$, $j${"checked":{"researched_on":"2026-09-30","approved_on":"2026-09-30","needs_lookup":true,"flag_reasons":["town certificate not confirmed online","no published fees found"],"verification":{"fees":0,"fee_ok":0,"fee_bad":0,"fee_unchecked":0,"quotes":2,"q_ok":2,"q_bad":0,"q_unchecked":0},"source":"property/data/municipal-requirements/checke